Well I was under somewhat of a time limit.  I wanted to get it under
the 15 minute limit for YouTube, and even that long is stretching the
abilities of my computer and camera.  So I was looking at the time on
the camera and thinking "oop, better finish this up!"  There was a lot
more I could have said.  But I'm not sure an hour of ranting about
lo/le would really benefit the new students that much anyway!

Incidentally, while I was making this video I was focusing intently on
thinking about lo/le and wandering randomly, so when I looked up after
I finished recording I had no idea where I was!  I barely found my way
out of the woods before it got dark!

